1
00:00:00,059 --> 00:00:02,129
(Bernadette:)I don't think you are.

2
00:00:02,128 --> 00:00:04,458
(Raj:)You didn't think I was gonna be
in your kitchen this morning,

3
00:00:04,463 --> 00:00:06,933
(Raj:)yet here I am.

4
00:00:13,139 --> 00:00:15,009
(Voice:)Psst, hey, kid.

5
00:00:15,007 --> 00:00:16,207
(Sheldon:)Huh, what?

6
00:00:18,945 --> 00:00:20,745
(The Flash(the voice):)You look tired.

7
00:00:20,746 --> 00:00:22,676
(The Flash(the voice):)Why don't you have
an energy drink?

8
00:00:22,682 --> 00:00:24,712
(The Flash(the voice):)Everyone's doing it.

9
00:00:24,717 --> 00:00:28,957
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, thank you,
those have caffeine in them.

10
00:00:28,955 --> 00:00:30,185
(The Flash:)Oh, sorry,

11
00:00:30,189 --> 00:00:32,119
(The Flash:)I thought you were cool.

12
00:00:33,826 --> 00:00:35,196
(Sheldon:)I am cool.

13
00:00:35,194 --> 00:00:36,864
(Sheldon:)This is Yoo-hoo,

14
00:00:36,862 --> 00:00:39,702
(Sheldon:)chocolate milk's
delicious watery cousin.

15
00:00:39,699 --> 00:00:41,199
(The Flash:)All right.

16
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,100
(The Flash:)But if you ever want to feel
like you have superpowers,

17
00:00:44,103 --> 00:00:45,903
(The Flash:)try one of these.

18
00:00:45,905 --> 00:00:49,075
(Sheldon:)Superheroes take
performance-enhancing chemicals?

19
00:00:49,075 --> 00:00:50,205
(The Flash:)You bet.

20
00:00:50,209 --> 00:00:52,809
(The Flash:)You know why Hulk
is so strong?

21
00:00:52,812 --> 00:00:55,022
(The Flash:)Steroids.

